  Rick Cutler just retired from 29 years of service with Irving
  PD. He will be moving to Guatemala serving as Director of
  Training & Logistics - Iris Relief.
  He will be training & equipping first responders (the body
  of Christ) in prevention, sustainability and preparness
  giving hope, saving lives and rescuing the one.
  Congratulations
  Comment as Piper
